            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Verdant Burst"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(healing)\n\nWhen a sunflower leshy dies, a burst of primal energy explodes from its body, restoring 1d8 Hit Points to each plant creature in a 30-foot emanation.\n\nThis area immediately fills with sunflowers, becoming difficult terrain. If the terrain is not a viable environment for these sunflowers, they wither after 24 hours."
