            "action_name": {
              "value": "Seed Spray"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(conjuration, primal)\n\nThe sunflower leshy launches a deluge of seeds from their head in a 15-foot cone, dealing 2d6 bludgeoning damage to creatures within the area (16 basic Reflex save). It gains a +2 status bonus to this damage against dazzled creatures. The sunflower leshy can't use Seed Spray again for 1d4 rounds."
